But my biggest worry is the other side that
has, you know, some of the players have been

00:01:09.079 --> 00:01:11.030
at this for a long time.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:15.570
And while we focus on the high profile people
and the things that make a lot of noise in

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:20.679
the bright, shiny objects like a large hail
of green, they're focused on the institutions

00:01:20.679 --> 00:01:27.409
that either support democracy or, if weakened,
could usher in, you know, the lack of democracy,

00:01:27.409 --> 00:01:31.649
