00:01:31.649 --> 00:01:35.939
And the reason I wrote the book is to say,
you know, it reminds me of the movie Don't

00:01:35.939 --> 00:01:41.759
look up, which I was at first afraid to watch,
but then glad I did it saying, don't only

00:01:41.759 --> 00:01:43.369
