00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:48.319
The institutions that shape our democracy
in so many ways are states.

00:01:48.319 --> 00:01:50.689
One side figured that out a long time ago.

00:01:50.689 --> 00:01:52.630
They have a minority view.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:56.399
They can only survive in a world without robust
democracy.

00:01:56.399 --> 00:02:00.460
So they've had their eye and tentacles on
