00:02:11.269 --> 00:02:13.439
And it's accelerating.

00:02:13.439 --> 00:02:18.230
And so it's sort of look at the institutions
don't just look at our usual politics, which

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:23.069
is, you know, federal majorities won through
swing districts and swing states.

00:02:23.069 --> 00:02:25.840
Look at the institutions that shape democracy.

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:27.349
Those are largely statehouses.

00:02:27.349 --> 00:02:32.290
Yes, the federal government can do important
things to protect against those they must.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:34.040
But the heart of it is at the state level.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:38.090
And I just think one side has been blind to
that for a generation.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:43.030
The other side has been focused on it like
a laser and our scoring victory after a victory.

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:44.030
Because of that.

