00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:24.690
And you know, it sounds very sort of that's
that's quite an accusation.

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:27.010
But we know what it looks like.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.599
It looks like hungry.

00:03:28.599 --> 00:03:31.290
And so we make this accusation.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:35.180
It's not really rebuttable anymore because
they're all going to hungry, celebrating it

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:37.340
in the wide open, you know?

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:41.079
Tucker Carlson, C-PAC, Trump, you know, endorsing
Auburn.

00:03:41.079 --> 00:03:47.079
They're not hiding the competitive autocracy
system that that, you know, we see in other

00:03:47.079 --> 00:03:48.079
countries.

00:03:48.079 --> 00:03:49.520
Is that what they want when they embrace Hungary?

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:55.370
And is I as I go through the book, almost
every element that Hungary is going through

00:03:55.370 --> 00:04:01.139
rigging legislative elections, suppressing
votes in the opposition party, attacking courts,

00:04:01.139 --> 00:04:06.019
almost every element that Hungary, you know,
go through the checklist is going through.

00:04:06.019 --> 00:04:09.180
You could overlay in the State House after
State House in our country.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.489
It's the same pattern.

00:04:10.489 --> 00:04:15.569
So it's not like they're only celebrating
it in twenty twenty two, it's either they've

00:04:15.569 --> 00:04:20.720
been modeling off of it or just doing the
