00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:05.150
Democracy, but to make everyone think that
it's it actually still is there in a viable

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.150
way.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.150
Speaker 1: That's a good point, right?

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:09.629
Because if
Speaker 4: people don't seem legitimate, if

00:05:09.629 --> 00:05:13.759
Speaker 1: people believe it's legitimate,
they are less likely to rise up against it.

00:05:13.759 --> 00:05:14.759
Speaker 4: Correct.

00:05:14.759 --> 00:05:16.910
